ver:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary dark:text-[var(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)]" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 34s</span></span></button></div></div></span><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-2"><button disabled="" class="text-token-text-secondary flex min-h-5 w-fit flex-row items-center gap-1.5 pt-[3px] text-start select-none">Failed to generate</button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ef22f230-8b62-4430-9ac3-5befa642c159" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-thinking"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="235">Here’s a working <strong data-start="17" data-end="40">single-file website</strong> that does exactly that: it generates a printable grid template (ASCII/Unicode ranges), lets you scan/photo the filled sheet, extracts glyph bitmaps, and builds a downloadable <strong data-start="216" data-end="223">TTF</strong> in-browser.</p>
<p data-start="237" data-end="370">I put the full code in the canvas → <strong data-start="273" data-end="313">Font-from-grid — Single-file Website</strong>. Save it as <code data-start="326" data-end="347">font-from-grid.html</code> and open in a browser.</p>
<p data-start="372" data-end="384">Quick start:</p>
<ol data-start="385" data-end="782">
<li data-start="385" data-end="537">
<p data-start="388" data-end="537">In “Template generator,” choose a range (ASCII 0x20–0x7E by default), set rows/cols, and click <strong data-start="483" data-end="501">Render preview</strong> → <strong data-start="504" data-end="520">Download PDF</strong> (print at 100%).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="538" data-end="602">
<p data-start="541" data-end="602">Draw your glyphs in black pen within each cell’s guide lines.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="603" data-end="735">
<p data-start="606" data-end="735">Scan or photograph (flat, high-contrast), upload in “Scan / photo → extraction,” tune <strong data-start="692" data-end="705">Threshold</strong>, and click <strong data-start="717" data-end="734">Process pages</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="736" data-end="782">
<p data-start="739" data-end="782">Click <strong data-start="745" data-end="758">Build TTF</strong>, then <strong data-start="765" data-end="781">Download TTF</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="784" data-end="790">Notes:</p>
<ul data-start="791" data-end="1140">
<li data-start="791" data-end="977">
<p data-start="793" data-end="977">The prototype uses a simple rectangular-per-pixel vectorization: crisp for blocky/monospace shapes. For smooth curves, we can later add contour tracing (marching squares) or OpenCV.js.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="978" data-end="1057">
<p data-start="980" data-end="1057">Baseline/x-height/ascender/descender guides are configurable in the template.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1058" data-end="1140">
<p data-start="1060" data-end="1140">It maps cells left→right, top→bottom across pages to the chosen codepoint range.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1142" data-end="1260" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want, I can also package this as a small repo with a README and a GitHub Pages setup so it deploys in one push.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879