oken-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="4051ff15-22bb-40b6-8881-81081b079194" data-testid="conversation-turn-8" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d388c9a0-e08b-4b14-873e-428e4c4a6890" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="149">Here’s a <strong data-start="9" data-end="70">comprehensive project specification and expansion roadmap</strong> for <strong data-start="75" data-end="93">Font from Grid</strong>, structured like a professional open-source proposal.</p>
<hr data-start="151" data-end="154">
<h2 data-start="156" data-end="170">1. Overview</h2>
<p data-start="172" data-end="469"><strong data-start="172" data-end="189">Project Name:</strong> Font from Grid<br data-start="204" data-end="207">
<strong data-start="207" data-end="223">Description:</strong> A browser-based platform that allows users to hand-design fonts using printable Unicode grids, scan or photograph the filled sheets, and automatically reconstruct vectorized <strong data-start="398" data-end="422">TrueType fonts (TTF)</strong> — all client-side with no server dependencies.</p>
<p data-start="471" data-end="490"><strong data-start="471" data-end="488">Core Concept:</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="491" data-end="607">
<p data-start="493" data-end="607">“Generate → Draw → Scan → Export”: a tactile, open-source bridge between analog creativity and digital typography.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="609" data-end="612">
<h2 data-start="614" data-end="635">2. Core Components</h2>
<h3 data-start="637" data-end="662">A. Template Generator</h3>
<ul data-start="663" data-end="988">
<li data-start="663" data-end="834">
<p data-start="665" data-end="834"><strong data-start="665" data-end="686">Input Parameters:</strong> Font name, page size (A4/Letter), rows/cols, cell size, margins, stroke width, baseline/x-height guides, Unicode range (ASCII, Latin-1, or custom).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="835" data-end="936">
<p data-start="837" data-end="858"><strong data-start="837" data-end="856">Output Formats:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="861" data-end="936">
<li data-start="861" data-end="893">
<p data-start="863" data-end="893"><strong data-start="863" data-end="870">PNG</strong> (for quick printing)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="896" data-end="936">
<p data-start="898" data-end="936"><strong data-start="898" data-end="905">PDF</strong> (via jsPDF, vector-friendly)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="937" data-end="988">
<p data-start="939" data-end="988"><strong data-start="939" data-end="953">Fiducials:</strong> Corner markers for scan alignment.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="990" data-end="1012">B. Glyph Extractor</h3>
<ul data-start="1013" data-end="1395">
<li data-start="1013" data-end="1088">
<p data-start="1015" data-end="1088"><strong data-start="1015" data-end="1026">Inputs:</strong> Scanned or photographed pages (<code data-start="1058" data-end="1064">.png</code>, <code data-start="1066" data-end="1072">.jpg</code>, <code data-start="1074" data-end="1081">.webp</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1089" data-end="1336">
<p data-start="1091" data-end="1115"><strong data-start="1091" data-end="1115">Processing Pipeline:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="1118" data-end="1336">
<li data-start="1118" data-end="1177">
<p data-start="1121" data-end="1177"><strong data-start="1121" data-end="1137">Thresholding</strong> → Binarization of black/white pixels.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1180" data-end="1227">
<p data-start="1183" data-end="1227"><strong data-start="1183" data-end="1199">Segmentation</strong> → Split by grid geometry.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1230" data-end="1289">
<p data-start="1233" data-end="1289"><strong data-start="1233" data-end="1249">Downsampling</strong> → Fixed resolution bitmaps per glyph.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1292" data-end="1336">
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1336"><strong data-start="1295" data-end="1306">Mapping</strong> → Link to Unicode codepoints.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li data-start="1337" data-end="1395">
<p data-start="1339" data-end="1395"><strong data-start="1339" data-end="1350">Output:</strong> Binary bitmaps and small previews per glyph.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1397" data-end="1415">C. TTF Builder</h3>
<ul data-start="1416" data-end="1708">
<li data-start="1416" data-end="1488">
<p data-start="1418" data-end="1488"><strong data-start="1418" data-end="1429">Engine:</strong> <a data-start="1430" data-end="1486" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://github.com/opentypejs/opentype.js">OpenType.js<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1489" data-end="1563">
<p data-start="1491" data-end="1563"><strong data-start="1491" data-end="1509">Vectorization:</strong> Simple rectangle per “on” pixel (blocky aesthetic).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1564" data-end="1636">
<p data-start="1566" data-end="1636"><strong data-start="1566" data-end="1578">Metrics:</strong> Units per em = 1000; Ascender = +800; Descender = −200.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1637" data-end="1708">
<p data-start="1639" data-end="1708"><strong data-start="1639" data-end="1650">Export:</strong> Downloadable <code data-start="1664" data-end="1670">.ttf</code> blob with metadata from the template.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1710" data-end="1713">
<h2 data-start="1715" data-end="1743">3. Technical Architecture</h2>
