<h2 data-start="2544" data-end="2571">5. Roadmap for Expansion</h2>
<h3 data-start="2573" data-end="2612"><strong data-start="2577" data-end="2612">Phase 1 — Usability &amp; Aesthetic</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="2613" data-end="2784">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2613" data-end="2647">
<p data-start="2619" data-end="2647"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add dark/light theme toggle.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2648" data-end="2685">
<p data-start="2654" data-end="2685"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add zoom/pan in canvas preview.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2686" data-end="2726">
<p data-start="2692" data-end="2726"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Enable drag-and-drop image upload.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2727" data-end="2784">
<p data-start="2733" data-end="2784"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Support mobile camera capture (via <code data-start="2768" data-end="2782">getUserMedia</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="2786" data-end="2823"><strong data-start="2790" data-end="2823">Phase 2 — Smart Vectorization</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="2824" data-end="3076">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2824" data-end="2898">
<p data-start="2830" data-end="2898"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Implement <strong data-start="2840" data-end="2860">marching squares</strong> or <strong data-start="2864" data-end="2897">Potrace-style contour tracing</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2899" data-end="2957">
<p data-start="2905" data-end="2957"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add <strong data-start="2909" data-end="2927">edge smoothing</strong> and <strong data-start="2932" data-end="2956">curve simplification</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2958" data-end="3028">
<p data-start="2964" data-end="3028"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Visual glyph editor with pixel eraser/brush tools before export.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3029" data-end="3076">
<p data-start="3035" data-end="3076"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Support variable advance width per glyph.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="3078" data-end="3119"><strong data-start="3082" data-end="3119">Phase 3 — Multi-Page and Metadata</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="3120" data-end="3291">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3120" data-end="3173">
<p data-start="3126" data-end="3173"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Auto-detect multi-page scans; merge seamlessly.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3174" data-end="3231">
<p data-start="3180" data-end="3231"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Embed <code data-start="3186" data-end="3192">name</code>, <code data-start="3194" data-end="3205">copyright</code>, and <code data-start="3211" data-end="3221">designer</code> metadata.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3232" data-end="3291">
<p data-start="3238" data-end="3291"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add JSON project save/load format (<code data-start="3273" data-end="3289">.fontgrid.json</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="3293" data-end="3332"><strong data-start="3297" data-end="3332">Phase 4 — Collaboration &amp; Cloud</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="3333" data-end="3514">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3333" data-end="3390">
<p data-start="3339" data-end="3390"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Save sessions to <strong data-start="3356" data-end="3369">IndexedDB</strong> or <strong data-start="3373" data-end="3389">localStorage</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3391" data-end="3453">
<p data-start="3397" data-end="3453"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Allow sharing template configuration via URL parameters.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3454" data-end="3514">
<p data-start="3460" data-end="3514"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Optional cloud sync (GitHub Gist / WebDAV / Firebase).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="3516" data-end="3550"><strong data-start="3520" data-end="3550">Phase 5 — Extended Formats</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="3551" data-end="3740">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3551" data-end="3626">
<p data-start="3557" data-end="3626"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Support <strong data-start="3565" data-end="3577">SVG Font</strong>, <strong data-start="3579" data-end="3587">WOFF</strong>, and <strong data-start="3593" data-end="3618">Bitmap Font (FNT/BDF)</strong> export.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3627" data-end="3682">
<p data-start="3633" data-end="3682"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add preview text field with live rendered sample.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3683" data-end="3740">
<p data-start="3689" data-end="3740"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Enable import of existing TTF for editing overlays.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="3742" data-end="3777"><strong data-start="3746" data-end="3777">Phase 6 — Advanced Scanning</strong></h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="3778" data-end="3966">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3778" data-end="3850">
<p data-start="3784" data-end="3850"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Implement <strong data-start="3794" data-end="3807">OpenCV.js</strong> or <strong data-start="3811" data-end="3828">TensorFlow.js</strong> deskew and alignment.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3851" data-end="3910">
<p data-start="3857" data-end="3910"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Auto-detect fiducial corners using contour detection.</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="3911" data-end="3966">
<p data-start="3917" data-end="3966"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Interactive correction tool for misaligned grids.</p>
