yling"><p data-start="0" data-end="204">Here’s a set of <strong data-start="16" data-end="35">potential names</strong> for the project, grouped by conceptual emphasis — from straightforward and descriptive to poetic or symbolic. Each includes a short rationale for tone and branding fit.</p>
