<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="331" data-end="924" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="331" data-end="361"><tr data-start="331" data-end="361"><th data-start="331" data-end="338" data-col-size="sm">Name</th><th data-start="338" data-end="361" data-col-size="md">Meaning / Rationale</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="393" data-end="924"><tr data-start="393" data-end="468"><td data-start="393" data-end="412" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="395" data-end="411">FontFromGrid</strong></td><td data-start="412" data-end="468" data-col-size="md">Straightforward and memorable; exactly what it does.</td></tr><tr data-start="469" data-end="544"><td data-start="469" data-end="484" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="471" data-end="483">GridFont</strong></td><td data-start="484" data-end="544" data-col-size="md">Minimalist; easy branding, short domain (<code data-start="527" data-end="540">gridfont.io</code>).</td></tr><tr data-start="545" data-end="604"><td data-start="545" data-end="562" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="547" data-end="561">DrawToFont</strong></td><td data-start="562" data-end="604" data-col-size="md">Emphasizes the analog-to-digital flow.</td></tr><tr data-start="605" data-end="669"><td data-start="605" data-end="620" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="607" data-end="619">HandFont</strong></td><td data-start="620" data-end="669" data-col-size="md">Friendly, artistic, very accessible branding.</td></tr><tr data-start="670" data-end="737"><td data-start="670" data-end="686" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="672" data-end="685">PaperFont</strong></td><td data-start="686" data-end="737" data-col-size="md">Suggests tactile origin — handwriting on paper.</td></tr><tr data-start="738" data-end="799"><td data-start="738" data-end="753" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="740" data-end="752">ScanFont</strong