<h2 data-start="931" data-end="968">2. <strong data-start="937" data-end="968">Creative / Conceptual Names</strong></h2>
<p data-start="969" data-end="1070">These highlight the <em data-start="989" data-end="1024">hybrid physical-digital aesthetic</em> and the creative act of constructing symbols.</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1072" data-end="1668" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1072" data-end="1102"><tr data-start="1072" data-end="1102"><th data-start="1072" data-end="1079" data-col-size="sm">Name</th><th data-start="1079" data-end="1102" data-col-size="md">Meaning / Rationale</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1134" data-end="1668"><tr data-start="1134" data-end="1196"><td data-start="1134" data-end="1152" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1136" data-end="1151">TypoGenesis</strong></td><td data-start="1152" data-end="1196" data-col-size="md">“Birth of type”; classical and dramatic.</td></tr><tr data-start="1197" data-end="1270"><td data-start="1197" data-end="1213" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1199" data-end="1212">GridForge</strong></td><td data-start="1213" data-end="1270" data-col-size="md">Suggests craftsmanship — forging fonts from geometry.</td></tr><tr data-start="1271" data-end="1332"><td data-start="1271" data-end="1288" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1273" data-end="1287">GlyphSmith</strong></td><td data-start="1288" data-end="1332" data-col-size="md">Echoes “blacksmith”; artisanal metaphor.</td></tr><tr data-start="1333" data-end="1402"><td data-start="1333" data-end="1351" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1335" data-end="1350">FontFoundry</strong></td><td data-start="1351" data-end="1402" data-col-size="md">Old-school typographic term — evokes tradition.</td></tr><tr data-start="1403" data-end="1472"><td data-start="1403" data-end="1426" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1405" data-end="1425">Codepoint Studio</strong></td><td data-start="1426" data-end="1472" data-col-size="md">Technical reference to Unicode codepoints.</td></tr><tr data-start="1473" data-end="1539"><td data-start="1473" data-end="1488" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1475" data-end="1487">Ink2Type</strong></td><td data-start="1488" data-end="1539" data-col-size="md">Playful and literal — from ink to digital type.</td></tr><tr data-start="1540" data-end="1600"><td data-start="1540" data-end="1557" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1542" data-end="1556">RasterType</strong></td><td data-start="1557" data-end="1600" data-col-size="md">Evokes the bitmap-to-vector transition.</td></tr><tr data-start="1601" data-end="1668"><td data-start="1601" data-end="1617" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1603" data-end="1616">Scanotype</strong></td><td data-start="1617" data-end="1668" data-col-size="md">Wordplay on “phototype” — retro-digital hybrid.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341