<h2 data-start="1675" data-end="1713">3. <strong data-start="1681" data-end="1713">Experimental / Minimal Names</strong></h2>
<p data-start="1714" data-end="1841">These fit your broader Flyxion aesthetic — single-word, slightly abstract, suggestive of generative or entropic transformation.</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1843" data-end="2480" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1843" data-end="1873"><tr data-start="1843" data-end="1873"><th data-start="1843" data-end="1850" data-col-size="sm">Name</th><th data-start="1850" data-end="1873" data-col-size="md">Meaning / Rationale</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1905" data-end="2480"><tr data-start="1905" data-end="1981"><td data-start="1905" data-end="1920" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1907" data-end="1919">Fiducial</strong></td><td data-start="1920" data-end="1981" data-col-size="md">Refers to the alignment marks — mathematical and elegant.</td></tr><tr data-start="1982" data-end="2052"><td data-start="1982" data-end="1995" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1984" data-end="1994">Typify</strong></td><td data-start="1995" data-end="2052" data-col-size="md">Verb form; both to represent and to make into a type.</td></tr><tr data-start="2053" data-end="2126"><td data-start="2053" data-end="2067" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2055" data-end="2066">Glyphon</strong></td><td data-start="2067" data-end="2126" data-col-size="md">Portmanteau of “glyph” + “photon”; digital-light motif.</td></tr><tr data-start="2127" data-end="2200"><td data-start="2127" data-end="2143" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2129" data-end="2142">Monoglyph</strong></td><td data-start="2143" data-end="2200" data-col-size="md">Singular essence of a glyph — also good for branding.</td></tr><tr data-start="2201" data-end="2273"><td data-start="2201" data-end="2215" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2203" data-end="2214">Unifont</strong></td><td data-start="2215" data-end="2273" data-col-size="md">Simplicity and universality; fits with Unicode themes.</td></tr><tr data-start="2274" data-end="2344"><td data-start="2274" data-end="2288" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2276" data-end="2287">Fontoid</strong></td><td data-start="2288" data-end="2344" data-col-size="md">Synthetic, techy — matches your other -oid projects.</td></tr><tr data-start="2345" data-end="2406"><td data-start="2345" data-end="2360" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2347" data-end="2359">Bitglyph</strong></td><td data-start="2360" data-end="2406" data-col-size="md">Links raster pixels to glyph construction.</td></tr><tr data-start="2407" data-end="2480"><td data-start="2407" data-end="2427" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2409" data-end="2426">Fontlabyrinth</strong></td><td data-start="2427" data-end="2480" data-col-size="md">More poetic — aligns with your aesthetic lineage.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.6302