<h2 data-start="2487" data-end="2525">4. <strong data-start="2493" data-end="2525">Integrative / Systemic Names</strong></h2>
<p data-start="2526" data-end="2652">These would connect it with your existing Flyxion ecosystem (RSVP, TARTAN, CLIO, HYDRA, etc.) and allow conceptual continuity.</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="2654" data-end="3406" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="2654" data-end="2675"><tr data-start="2654" data-end="2675"><th data-start="2654" data-end="2661" data-col-size="sm">Name</th><th data-start="2661" data-end="2675" data-col-size="lg">Connection</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2699" data-end="3406"><tr data-start="2699" data-end="2820"><td data-start="2699" data-end="2713" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2701" data-end="2712">TESSERA</strong></td><td data-start="2713" data-end="2820" data-col-size="lg">Latin for “tile”; echoes TARTAN’s recursive tiling — each glyph as a tessera in the mosaic of language.</td></tr><tr data-start="2821" data-end="2894"><td data-start="2821" data-end="2835" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2823" data-end="2834">LAMINAR</strong></td><td data-start="2835" data-end="2894" data-col-size="lg">Refers to smooth flow — in this case, from ink to type.</td></tr><tr data-start="2895" data-end="2987"><td data-start="2895" data-end="2910" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2897" data-end="2909">MANIFOLD</strong></td><td data-start="2910" data-end="2987" data-col-size="lg">Ties to your geometric formalism; each glyph a manifold in Unicode space.</td></tr><tr data-start="2988" data-end="3056"><td data-start="2988" data-end="3004" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2990" data-end="3003">ENTROTYPE</strong></td><td data-start="3004" data-end="3056" data-col-size="lg">“Entropy + Type”; mirrors RSVP’s entropic logic.</td></tr><tr data-start="3057" data-end="3164"><td data-start="3057" data-end="3074" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3059" data-end="3073">PLENUMTYPE</strong></td><td data-start="3074" data-end="3164" data-col-size="lg">Aligns with Relativistic Scalar-Vector Plenum (RSVP); fonts as density fields of form.</td></tr><tr data-start="3165" data-end="3257"><td data-start="3165" data-end="3179" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3167" data-end="3178">ISOGRID</strong></td><td data-start="3179" data-end="3257" data-col-size="lg">Iso-surface + grid — geometric precision, fits your simulation vocabulary.</td></tr><tr data-start="3258" data-end="3339"><td data-start="3258" data-end="3273" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3260" data-end="3272">SEMATYPE</strong></td><td data-start="3273" data-end="3339" data-col-size="lg">“Semantic Type” — conceptual bridge between glyph and meaning.</td></tr><tr data-start="3340" data-end="3406"><td data-start="3340" data-end="3355" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3342" data-end="3354">ANALOGON</strong></td><td data-start="3355" data-end="3406" data-col-size="lg">Philosophical: the analog twin of digital text.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 