<h3 data-start="3413" data-end="3485">Personal Shortlist (Balanced for Public Clarity + Theoretical Depth)</h3>
<ol data-start="3486" data-end="3798">
<li data-start="3486" data-end="3543">
<p data-start="3489" data-end="3543"><strong data-start="3489" data-end="3501">GridFont</strong> — crisp, approachable, instantly clear.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3544" data-end="3596">
<p data-start="3547" data-end="3596"><strong data-start="3547" data-end="3562">TypoGenesis</strong> — poetic, memorable, scholarly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3597" data-end="3659">
<p data-start="3600" data-end="3659"><strong data-start="3600" data-end="3614">GlyphSmith</strong> — craftsman-like and open-source-friendly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3660" data-end="3733">
<p data-start="3663" data-end="3733"><strong data-start="3663" data-end="3676">Entrotype</strong> — elegant bridge to RSVP and entropy-based frameworks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3734" data-end="3798">
<p data-start="3737" data-end="3798"><strong data-start="3737" data-end="3748">Tessera</strong> — integrative, geometric, and uniquely “Flyxion.”</p>
</li>
</ol>
