---

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## 1. Overview</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Font-from-Grid**</span></span><span> is an entirely client-side, open-source system for converting </span><span><span class="hljs-emphasis">*hand-drawn characters on printed grids*</span></span><span> into fully functional </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**TrueType fonts (TTF)**</span></span><span>.  
It unifies analog creativity and digital typography through a closed causal loop:

</span><span><span class="hljs-quote">&gt; <span class="hljs-strong">**Generate → Draw → Scan → Export**</span></span></span><span>

Each stage — template creation, glyph extraction, and font synthesis — operates within the browser using </span><span><span class="hljs-code">`Canvas`</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-code">`OpenType.js`</span></span><span>, and </span><span><span class="hljs-code">`jsPDF`</span></span><span>, requiring no backend or external service.

---

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## 2. Core Objectives</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Democratize custom type design without specialized software.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Preserve the tactile quality of handwriting in digital media.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Serve as an open reference model for </span><span><span class="hljs-emphasis">*physical-digital font reconstruction*</span></span><span>.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Provide a modular base for future AI/ML vectorization and stylization pipelines.

---

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## 3. Functional Specification</span></span><span>

| Component | Function | Libraries / Standards |
|------------|-----------|-----------------------|
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Template Generator**</span></span><span> | Produces printable grid sheets labeled by Unicode codepoints with configurable geometry and typographic guides. | Canvas 2D, jsPDF |
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Glyph Extractor**</span></span><span> | Parses scanned or photographed pages, segments by grid, thresholds, and downsamples each glyph bitmap. | Canvas 2D |
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**TTF Builder**</span></span><span> | Converts bitmaps into vectorized rectangles per pixel, producing a valid OpenType font. | OpenType.js |
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Export / Download**</span></span><span> | Exports PNG/PDF for templates and TTF for fonts. | Native browser APIs |

---

