</span><span><span class="hljs-section">### 4.2 Data Flow</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">1.</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Template Generation**</span></span><span> → Canvas render → PNG/PDF output.  
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">2.</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**User Interaction**</span></span><span> → Printed drawing → scanned image input.  
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">3.</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Glyph Extraction**</span></span><span> → Thresholding → grid segmentation → bitmaps.  
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">4.</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**TTF Construction**</span></span><span> → Rectangular vectorization → OpenType font object → Blob download.

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">### 4.3 Parameters</span></span><span>
| Setting | Default | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| Page size | Letter | A4 optional |
| Grid columns | 16 | per page |
| Grid rows | 12 | per page |
| Cell size | 160 px | approximate printable cell |
| Threshold | 170 | grayscale cutoff |
| Downsample | 48×48 | per-glyph bitmap resolution |

