</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## 6. Design Rationale</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**No server dependency:**</span></span><span> Ensures privacy and reproducibility.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Declarative geometry:**</span></span><span> Font grids defined by exact cell metrics; reproducible across DPI and paper formats.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Accessible vectorization:**</span></span><span> Uses simple pixel rectangles for deterministic output; future contour tracing optional.
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Educational transparency:**</span></span><span> Designed to teach how Unicode, grid systems, and font curves interrelate.

---

