</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## 9. Future Vision</span></span><span>

Font-from-Grid aspires to become a </span><span><span class="hljs-emphasis">*universal, open handwriting-to-type system*</span></span><span> — an accessible educational gateway into font design, computational geometry, and perceptual encoding.

It stands at the boundary between </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**craft and computation**</span></span><span>, translating embodied gesture into vector geometry and symbolic language.

