essage-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="180">Perfect — the <strong data-start="14" data-end="34">Retro Monitor UI</strong> direction aligns beautifully with your Flyxion aesthetic (green phosphor glow, vector lines, glitch flicker, black background, soft scanlines).</p>
<p data-start="182" data-end="215">Here’s what I’ll generate next:</p>
<hr data-start="217" data-end="220">
<h3 data-start="222" data-end="294"><strong data-start="226" data-end="294">Upgraded <code data-start="237" data-end="249">index.html</code> — “Font-from-Grid: Retro Terminal Edition”</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start="296" data-end="316">✦ Visual Design</h4>
<ul data-start="317" data-end="559">
<li data-start="317" data-end="344">
<p data-start="319" data-end="344">Black background (#000)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="345" data-end="381">
<p data-start="347" data-end="381">Neon-green vector font aesthetic</p>
</li>
<li data-start="382" data-end="443">
<p data-start="384" data-end="443">CRT scanline texture (via subtle linear-gradient overlay)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="444" data-end="499">
<p data-start="446" data-end="499">Glowing borders, flicker animation, monospaced text</p>
</li>
<li data-start="500" data-end="559">
<p data-start="502" data-end="559">Responsive layout with minimal but tactile interactions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="561" data-end="587">✦ Functional Upgrades</h4>
<ul data-start="588" data-end="926">
<li data-start="588" data-end="620">
<p data-start="590" data-end="620">Drag-and-drop zone for scans</p>
</li>
<li data-start="621" data-end="647">
<p data-start="623" data-end="647">Live threshold preview</p>
</li>
<li data-start="648" data-end="720">
<p data-start="650" data-end="720">Dark theme toggle replaced with a “Power” switch (green glow on/off)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="721" data-end="788">
<p data-start="723" data-end="788">Keyboard shortcuts (<code data-start="743" data-end="746">R</code>, <code data-start="748" data-end="751">P</code>, <code data-start="753" data-end="756">B</code> for Render / Process / Build)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="789" data-end="848">
<p data-start="791" data-end="848">Improved status console (scrollable log with timestamp)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="849" data-end="887">
<p data-start="851" data-end="887">Safe blob revocation on new builds</p>
</li>
<li data-start="888" data-end="926">
<p data-start="890" data-end="926">Tooltips styled as terminal popups</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="928" data-end="954">✦ Structural Upgrades</h4>
<ul data-start="955" data-end="1224">
<li data-start="955" data-end="1054">
<p data-start="957" data-end="1054">Still a single self-contained file — no external dependencies beyond <code data-start="1026" data-end="1039">OpenType.js</code> and <code data-start="1044" data-end="1051">jsPDF</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1055" data-end="1150">
<p data-start="1057" data-end="1150">Uses ES6 modules internally to isolate logic blocks (<code data-start="1110" data-end="1120">template</code>, <code data-start="1122" data-end="1131">extract</code>, <code data-start="1133" data-end="1140">build</code>, <code data-start="1142" data-end="1146">ui</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1151" data-end="1224">
<p data-start="1153" data-end="1224">Inline CSS variables (<code data-start="1175" data-end="1188">--crt-green</code>, <code data-start="1190" data-end="1202">--crt-dark</code>) for quick theming.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1226" data-end="1229">
<p data-start="1231" data-end="1280">Before I build it, one more stylistic question:</p>
<p data-start="1282" data-end="1336">Would you prefer the <strong data-start="1303" data-end="1322">retro aesthetic</strong> to emulate:</p>
<ol data-start="1337" data-end="1514">
<li data-start="1337" data-end="1422">
<p data-start="1340" data-end="1422"><strong data-start="1340" data-end="1357">Classic VT100</strong> (pure monochrome green terminal, grid lines, text flicker), or</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1423" data-end="1514">
<p data-start="1426" data-end="1514"><strong data-start="1426" data-end="1457">1980s vector-monitor arcade</strong> (slight bloom, glowing outlines, animated highlights)?</p>
