Here’s what I’ll build into the next version of <code data-start="180" data-end="192">index.html</code>:</p>
<hr data-start="195" data-end="198">
<h3 data-start="200" data-end="254"><strong data-start="204" data-end="254">Design Specification — VT100 Research Terminal</strong></h3>
<p data-start="256" data-end="273"><strong data-start="256" data-end="273">Visual System</strong></p>
<ul data-start="274" data-end="606">
<li data-start="274" data-end="296">
<p data-start="276" data-end="296">Background <code data-start="287" data-end="296">#000000</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="297" data-end="313">
<p data-start="299" data-end="313">Text <code data-start="304" data-end="313">#00FF00</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="314" data-end="370">
<p data-start="316" data-end="370">Subtle phosphor blur (<code data-start="338" data-end="369">text-shadow: 0 0 2px #00FF00;</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="371" data-end="426">
<p data-start="373" data-end="426">Thin scanline overlay using repeating linear-gradient</p>
</li>
<li data-start="427" data-end="493">
<p data-start="429" data-end="493">Monospaced font: <em data-start="446" data-end="461">IBM Plex Mono</em>, <em data-start="463" data-end="474">Fira Mono</em>, or <em data-start="479" data-end="493">ui-monospace</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start="494" data-end="545">
<p data-start="496" data-end="545">No gradients or colors other than green and black</p>
</li>
<li data-start="546" data-end="606">
<p data-start="548" data-end="606">Optional cursor blink on status line (<code data-start="586" data-end="595">::after</code> animation)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="608" data-end="618"><strong data-start="608" data-end="618">Layout</strong></p>
<ul data-start="619" data-end="913">
<li data-start="619" data-end="663">
<p data-start="621" data-end="663">Single-column, centered up to 110 ch width</p>
</li>
<li data-start="664" data-end="787">
<p data-start="666" data-end="714">Section titles prefixed with ASCII lines, e.g.</p>
