</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="788" data-end="855">
<p data-start="790" data-end="855">Canvas preview and log console framed with box-drawing characters</p>
</li>
<li data-start="856" data-end="913">
<p data-start="858" data-end="913">Consistent spacing via CSS variables (<code data-start="896" data-end="903">--pad</code>, <code data-start="905" data-end="912">--gap</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="915" data-end="932"><strong data-start="915" data-end="932">Interactivity</strong></p>
<ul data-start="933" data-end="1254">
<li data-start="933" data-end="1028">
<p data-start="935" data-end="954">Keyboard shortcuts:</p>
<ul data-start="957" data-end="1028">
<li data-start="957" data-end="982">
<p data-start="959" data-end="982"><code data-start="959" data-end="962">R</code> → Render Template</p>
</li>
<li data-start="985" data-end="1008">
<p data-start="987" data-end="1008"><code data-start="987" data-end="990">P</code> → Process Scans</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1011" data-end="1028">
<p data-start="1013" data-end="1028"><code data-start="1013" data-end="1016">B</code> → Build TTF</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1029" data-end="1093">
<p data-start="1031" data-end="1093">Terminal-style log window appends time-stamped status messages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1094" data-end="1157">
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1157">Drag-and-drop zone for scan images (<code data-start="1132" data-end="1156">Drop files to process…</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1158" data-end="1199">
<p data-start="1160" data-end="1199">Live threshold slider updates instantly</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1200" data-end="1254">
<p data-start="1202" data-end="1254">Progress bar rendered as ASCII: <code data-start="1234" data-end="1254">[#####.....] (45%)</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1256" data-end="1274"><strong data-start="1256" data-end="1274">Implementation</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1275" data-end="1551">
<li data-start="1275" data-end="1309">
<p data-start="1277" data-end="1309">Pure HTML + CSS + ES6 JavaScript</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1310" data-end="1468">
<p data-start="1312" data-end="1340">Two modules inside one file:</p>
