<h4 data-start="472" data-end="490">1. The Toggle</h4>
<ul data-start="491" data-end="689">
<li data-start="491" data-end="552">
<p data-start="493" data-end="552">A small switch at the top right: <code data-start="526" data-end="552">[MODE: Terminal ⟷ Paper]</code></p>
