<h4 data-start="1227" data-end="1252">4. Keyboard Shortcut</h4>
<p data-start="1253" data-end="1303"><code data-start="1253" data-end="1256">M</code> → toggles mode between <em data-start="1280" data-end="1290">terminal</em> and <em data-start="1295" data-end="1302">paper</em>.</p>
<h4 data-start="1305" data-end="1328">5. Canvas Handling</h4>
<ul data-start="1329" data-end="1565">
<li data-start="1329" data-end="1484">
<p data-start="1331" data-end="1375">Canvas preview background changes with mode:</p>
<ul data-start="1378" data-end="1484">
<li data-start="1378" data-end="1431">
<p data-start="1380" data-end="1431">In terminal mode: black background with green lines</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1434" data-end="1484">
<p data-start="1436" data-end="1484">In paper mode: white background with black lines</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1485" data-end="1565">
<p data-start="1487" data-end="1565">PDF and PNG exports remain unaffected (still black-on-white printable output).</p>
</li>
</ul>
