v class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e5220a66-4a52-4e86-86e1-8a2bb7e87803" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="224">Excellent — that’s a perfect complement to the system: a <strong data-start="57" data-end="83">font testing interface</strong> that generates randomized “gibberish” text pages using your custom fonts, for visual evaluation of spacing, kerning, rhythm, and legibility.</p>
<p data-start="226" data-end="303">Here’s what I’ll include in <code data-start="254" data-end="282">font-from-grid-site-v5.zip</code> as <code data-start="286" data-end="302">interface.html</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="305" data-end="308">
<h2 data-start="310" data-end="364">🌐 <strong data-start="316" data-end="364">interface.html — Random Word Sheet Generator</strong></h2>
<p data-start="366" data-end="514"><strong data-start="366" data-end="378">Purpose:</strong> Generate printable pages filled with randomized, pronounceable nonsense words (using the same name generator logic) to test your fonts.</p>
<h3 data-start="516" data-end="531">✳️ Features</h3>
<ul data-start="533" data-end="919">
<li data-start="533" data-end="668">
<p data-start="535" data-end="546">Adjustable:</p>
<ul data-start="549" data-end="668">
<li data-start="549" data-end="575">
<p data-start="551" data-end="575">Number of pages (<code data-start="568" data-end="574">1–20</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="578" data-end="603">
<p data-start="580" data-end="603">Words per line (<code data-start="596" data-end="602">3–20</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="606" data-end="632">
<p data-start="608" data-end="632">Lines per page (<code data-start="624" data-end="631">10–50</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="635" data-end="668">
<p data-start="637" data-end="668">Minimum and maximum word length</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="669" data-end="723">
<p data-start="671" data-end="723">Font selector (dropdown of system + uploaded <code data-start="716" data-end="722">.ttf</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="724" data-end="743">
<p data-start="726" data-end="743">Live preview area</p>
</li>
<li data-start="744" data-end="810">
<p data-start="746" data-end="810">Export to <strong data-start="756" data-end="777">PDF (vector text)</strong> or <strong data-start="781" data-end="788">PNG</strong> for quick print tests</p>
</li>
<li data-start="811" data-end="870">
<p data-start="813" data-end="870">Modes: Terminal (green-on-black) / Paper (black-on-white)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="871" data-end="919">
<p data-start="873" data-end="919">Uses same CRT flicker aesthetic for continuity</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="921" data-end="924">
