<p data-start="3237" data-end="3387">Each simulation frame is effectively a discrete RSVP time-slice: Φ encodes energy potential; 𝒗 encodes active flow; S encodes memory and dissipation.</p>
<hr data-start="3389" data-end="3392">
<h2 data-start="3394" data-end="3459">5. Empirical Interpretation: RSVP as Morphogenetic Computation</h2>
<p data-start="3461" data-end="3510">The simulator operationalizes the RSVP view that:</p>
<ul data-start="3511" data-end="3690">
<li data-start="3511" data-end="3549">
<p data-start="3513" data-end="3549"><strong data-start="3513" data-end="3546">Information = negentropy flow</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3550" data-end="3622">
<p data-start="3552" data-end="3622"><strong data-start="3552" data-end="3619">Computation = entropy minimization under continuity constraints</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3623" data-end="3690">
<p data-start="3625" data-end="3690"><strong data-start="3625" data-end="3690">Cognition = recursive entropic coupling of fields and agents.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3692" data-end="3940">Therefore, Xenobot behavior—emergent cooperation, avoidance, and adaptation—is not merely a robotics phenomenon but a <strong data-start="3810" data-end="3841">field-theoretic computation</strong>, demonstrating that RSVP’s formal entropy–vector coupling can yield biological-scale organization.</p>
<hr data-start="3942" data-end="3945">
<h2 data-start="3947" data-end="3963">6. Next Steps</h2>
<ul data-start="3965" data-end="4399">
<li data-start="3965" data-end="4057">
<p data-start="3967" data-end="4057"><strong data-start="3967" data-end="3991">RSVP–Neural mapping:</strong> evolve neural controllers that explicitly compute ∇Φ and ∂S/∂t.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4058" data-end="4164">
<p data-start="4060" data-end="4164"><strong data-start="4060" data-end="4087">Quantum RSVP extension:</strong> implement stochastic coherence in the agent updates (unistochastic noise).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4165" data-end="4277">
<p data-start="4167" data-end="4277"><strong data-start="4167" data-end="4192">Empirical validation:</strong> map entropy flux vs. energy uptake to biological xenobot data (Levin Lab analogs).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4278" data-end="4399">
<p data-start="4280" data-end="4399"><strong data-start="4280" data-end="4307">Cross-domain synthesis:</strong> treat every emergent swarm as a <em data-start="4340" data-end="4367">coarse-grained RSVP patch</em> in a universal field simulator.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4401" data-end="4404">
<h3 data-start="4406" data-end="4417">Summary</h3>
<p data-start="4419" data-end="4488"><strong data-start="4419" data-end="4488">RSVP provides the physics; Xenobot Swarms provide the experiment.</strong></p>
<p data-start="4490" data-end="4746" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">The simulator is the first digital laboratory where the <strong data-start="4546" data-end="4583">Relativistic Scalar–Vector Plenum</strong>’s entropic and vector dynamics manifest in living-like, adaptive collectives—bridging theoretical cosmology, thermodynamic cognition, and synthetic morphogenesis.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186