&lt;body&gt;
  &lt;h1&gt;╔═ Stars! RSVP Evolutionary Tech Tree v2.0 ═══════════╗&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;div class="panel grid2"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;
      &lt;div class="row"&gt;
        &lt;button id="start"&gt;Start&lt;/button&gt;
