<p data-start="64628" data-end="64914">\section{Discussion}<br>
We find that entropy-penalized fitness in a stigmergic environment drives efficient path planning, division of labor via genetic specialization, and robustness to nutrient scarcity. RSVP provides a compact field-theoretic description aligned with active inference.</p>
