| **λ &gt; 0 prevents collapse** | Entropy penalty = **inner alignment term**; without it, agents over-optimize |
| **<code>entropyThreshold</code> evolves** | Agents learn to **self-regulate** based on internal waste signals |
| **Factory hypercycles** | Recursive self-improvement can **destabilize** without damping |
