Part of the </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Research Projects**</span></span><span> suite.

This project allows you to:
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Generate printable ASCII/Unicode grids
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Scan them with your camera or upload them
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Use OpenCV to reconstruct a vector font from scanned samples

</span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Location:**</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-code">`research-projects/font-from-grid`</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Modes**</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Terminal:**</span></span><span> Retro green-on-black
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Paper:**</span></span><span> Black-on-white for printing
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Heterodox:**</span></span><span> White-on-black for inverse luminance testing

</span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Build &amp; Run**</span></span><span>
<span class="hljs-code">```bash
python generate_fonts.py
python -m http.server 8080
</span></span></span></code></div></div></pre>
