| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Xenobot Swarm Simulator v2.1**</span></span><span> | Bio-inspired morphogenetic evolution in RSVP fields (Φ, v, S). Models stigmergy, entropy trails, and emergent cooperation. |
